  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/AetherAndVoid_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You become a living void of aether, giving you incredible resilience to magic.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, you take <strong>1</strong> less <strong>Damage</strong> from spells or magical abilities. You also gain <strong>+1</strong> <strong>bonus dice</strong> on any checks made against spells or magical abilities.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 round</strong>s.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase both the <strong>Damage</strong> reduction and the bonus to <strong>Resistance</strong> checks by +1 per extra success.</p>",
